{title: Vacation}
{lyricist: Sergio Rykov}
{composer: Sergio Rykov}

{start_of_verse}
We don't say that word out loud,
We're not afraid to breathe freely,
We're not trying to dodge the blame
Of hefty fines - and to hell with those too
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
We're fed up with quarantine, masks and gloves,
Everyone can go to... and these rules as well
Fly and walk off the other way,
Where the hefty fines go to hell
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Aaaaa Vacation
Aaaaa Two
Aaaaa No need
Aaaaa to nowhere
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
Give me a vacation
Give me two
No need in masks
Better to nowhere
{end_of_bridge}
